cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MUSCA, please cite it and the underlying MaleCNS dataset."
title: "MUSCA — an interactive map of the complete male fruit fly central nervous system"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free browser application that renders all 166,700 neurons and
  2.8 million pruned synaptic connections of the MaleCNS v1.0 connectome, and
  lets you propagate activity forward across real synapses or search the
  wiring diagram backwards from a behaviour to the cells that cause it.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-13
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - Drosophila
  - neuroscience
  - WebGL
  - data visualisation
